  "external_generalization": false,
  "finding_en": "In this public-CFD proxy, camera count and exact iteration depth remain the dominant bottlenecks. Factorized stress perturbations produce smaller but measurable tail degradation. Geometry PCGLS more often reduces observation residual, yet does not consistently improve field or gradient error. Both two-call classical controls miss CGLS-K4 field accuracy in all 3,700 cells, leaving explicit development headroom for a minimal camera-set warm initializer.",
  "finding_zh": "在当前公开 CFD 代理中，相机数量和精确迭代深度仍是主要瓶颈。因子化 stress 误差只带来较小但可测的尾部退化；几何 PCGLS 更常降低观测残差，却没有稳定改善场或梯度。两种 2-call 经典方法在全部 3700 个单元都未追平 CGLS-K4 的场误差，因此最小相机集合 warm initializer 仍有明确开发空间。",
