  "next_gate_en": "Freeze a minimal permutation-equivariant SetDual-Warm model: a shared per-camera encoder reads displacement and the 18-D pose token, set pooling produces per-camera dual proposals, and exact A^T, an observable line search, plus one unmodified CGLS refinement retain a 2A+2A^T budget. First compare fairly with CGLS-K2, PCGLS-K2, and dual ridge, targeting K4 accuracy.",
  "next_gate_zh": "冻结一个最小 permutation-equivariant SetDual-Warm：共享单相机编码器读取位移图和 18 维位姿 token，集合池化后输出每相机 dual proposal，经精确 A^T、可观测线搜索和一次未修改 CGLS refinement 保持 2A+2A^T；先与 CGLS-K2、PCGLS-K2、dual-ridge 公平比较，目标追平 K4。",
